# Optimizer predicate pushdown EXPLAIN plan-shape assertions.
#
# LIMITATION: The assertion engine (integration_test.py) checks global
# substring presence — it CANNOT verify relative position of nodes.
# Plan-tree structure (Filter above/below Join) is verified by unit tests
# 2-20 in src/sql/optimizer/rewrite.rs::tests.
#
# These assertions verify: (1) optimizer produces plans with expected
# operators and conditions, (2) filter conditions appear in EXPLAIN output.

# E1-E4: All plans should show a Filter operator
Filter

# E1: left-only filter condition (a.x = 10) appears
(x = 10)

# E2: left-only filter condition (a.x > 10) appears
(x > 10)

# E3: right-side filter condition (b.y > 100) appears
(y > 100)

# E4: split push — both conditions appear
(y > 50)

# Hash Join appears for equi-join queries (E1-E4 use a.id = b.id)
Hash Join

# E7: non-equi comma-join → Nested Loop survives
Nested Loop
